# 0.2.3: user space only (zsleepd charger, its unit, the updater, ztsettings).
# KERNEL_FILES is cumulative: what the releases before put in stays listed, so
# a phone that jumps from 0.2 straight to 0.2.3 gets 0.2.2's module too (the
# delta from 0.2.2 leaves it out: unchanged). Nothing else of the kernel side.
KERNEL_FILES="usr/local/lib/zboot/tools/zrn-system-sleep-bx.ko"
